msgid "软件验证、源码身份与证据"
msgstr "Software verification, source identity and evidence"

msgid ""
"本页导航已有执行记录，不建立本次文档 HEAD 的平台软件资格。必须同时比对 源码、装配、依赖、工具、实际执行与同一 ELF／BIN／map "
"字节，不能只看 passed。 资格规则由 [资格合同](../delivery/qualification.md)维护。"
msgstr ""
"This page navigates existing execution records; it does not establish "
"platform-software qualification for this documentation HEAD. Compare source,"
" assembly, dependencies, tools, actual execution and the same ELF/BIN/map "
"bytes together, rather than reading passed alone. The [qualification "
"contract](../delivery/qualification.md) maintains qualification rules."

msgid "三种身份分别解释"
msgstr "Interpret three identities separately"

msgid ""
"下面字段用于成功打包的正式站点与离线包。构建预览先查看 `documentation-build.json` 的 `source`、状态和原命令 "
"receipts；预览尚没有正式 `documentation-manifest.json`，也不据此声称发行完成。"
msgstr ""
"The following fields apply to successfully packaged formal sites and offline"
" packages. For build previews, first inspect `source`, status and original "
"command receipts in `documentation-build.json`. A preview has no formal "
"`documentation-manifest.json` yet and does not establish release completion."

msgid "身份"
msgstr "Identity"

msgid "取得位置"
msgstr "Location"

msgid "含义"
msgstr "Meaning"

msgid "当前代码源码"
msgstr "Current code source"

msgid "站点 `documentation-manifest.json` 的 `code_source`"
msgstr "`code_source` in the site's `documentation-manifest.json`"

msgid "本站描述的 checkout、tree、dirty 状态和代码路径"
msgstr ""
"The checkout, tree, dirty status and code paths described by this site"

msgid "当前文档源码"
msgstr "Current documentation source"

msgid "同一 manifest 的 `documentation_source`"
msgstr "`documentation_source` in the same manifest"

msgid "本次正式文档包的精确 commit/tree；不替代预览构建记录"
msgstr ""
"Exact commit/tree for this formal documentation package; not a replacement "
"for preview-build records"

msgid "被引用资格源码"
msgstr "Referenced qualification source"

msgid "同一 manifest 的 `qualified_code` 与其结果索引"
msgstr "`qualified_code` and its results index in the same manifest"

msgid "旧的精确代码执行；不是当前代码／文档 HEAD 自动继承的资格"
msgstr ""
"Earlier exact-code execution; no qualification automatically inherited by "
"current code/documentation HEAD"

msgid ""
"成功打包后，公开站点和离线包的 manifest 由实际构建输入生成。Git HEAD 可以因文档提交改变； 这里不手填一个很快漂移的 HEAD "
"常量。未打包的工作树可执行 `git rev-parse HEAD` 核对 checkout，但命令输出本身不是 qualification "
"receipt。"
msgstr ""
"After successful packaging, manifests for the public site and offline "
"package derive from actual build inputs. Documentation commits may change "
"Git HEAD; this page does not manually insert a rapidly drifting HEAD "
"constant. An unpackaged working tree can run `git rev-parse HEAD` to check "
"its checkout, but that command output alone is not a qualification receipt."

msgid "已有三个独立结果索引"
msgstr "Three existing independent results indexes"

msgid "范围"
