"{download}`结果索引 <../delivery/soc-refinement-"
"results.json>`、[执行记录](../delivery/soc-refinement-verification.md)"
msgstr ""
"{download}`Results index <../delivery/soc-refinement-results.json>`, "
"[execution records](../delivery/soc-refinement-verification.md)"

msgid ""
"三个索引保留原 schema、范围、失败尝试、receipt、归档和 member 身份，不能相加 测试次数、ARM "
"镜像数或任务数量，也不能据此计算全项目完成率。后续文档 commit 只记录这些基线。当前文档的检查、渲染、离线恢复与部署验证各自有独立记录。"
msgstr ""
"The three indexes retain their original schemas, scopes, failed attempts, "
"receipts, archives and member identities. Do not add test executions, ARM "
"images or task counts, or calculate a project-wide completion rate. Later "
"documentation commits only record these baselines. Current documentation "
"checking, rendering, offline recovery and deployment validation each have "
"independent records."

msgid ""
"构建系统记录没有执行一次完整 72-stage 软件总计划，也没有执行 OCI recipe 重建、 CP311 离线安装、Windows/macOS "
"集成或 MCU HIL。独立执行过的具体 scopes 按原索引 解释；不要从其 aggregate 状态扩大结论。八个当前无签名软件候选是 H743 "
"HSI64／ Cache off 和 U575 MSIS4／TZEN=0 的 empty／UART、裸机／FreeRTOS 组合。"
msgstr ""
"The build-system records did not execute one complete 72-stage software "
"master plan, OCI recipe reconstruction, CP311 offline installation, "
"Windows/macOS integration or MCU HIL. Interpret independently executed "
"scopes according to their original indexes; do not expand conclusions from "
"aggregate status. Eight current unsigned software candidates combine "
"empty/UART and baremetal/FreeRTOS for H743 HSI64/Cache off and U575 "
"MSIS4/TZEN=0."

msgid "如何取得与核对旧证据"
msgstr "Acquire and verify earlier evidence"

msgid "先打开对应结果索引，确认 canonical code commit、配置和记录 scope。"
msgstr ""
"Open the corresponding results index and confirm the canonical code commit, "
"configuration and recorded scope."

msgid "使用索引中的归档定位，核对归档 SHA-256 和 bytes；记录失败尝试的原身份。"
msgstr ""
"Locate the archive through the index and verify SHA-256 and bytes; retain "
"the original identities of failed attempts."

msgid ""
"根据 `archive_relative_path`、`archive_member_relative_path` 等原字段定位 member， "
"继续核对该 member 的 hash 和 bytes。字段名因原 schema 而不同，按该索引解释。"
msgstr ""
"Locate members using original fields such as `archive_relative_path` and "
"`archive_member_relative_path`, then verify each member's hash and bytes. "
"Field names vary by original schema; interpret them according to that index."

msgid "查看实际执行记录、原始日志和同一产物。软件模型、链接、独立消费和两次断网 重建分别证明自己的范围，某一类成功不替代另一类。"
msgstr ""
"Inspect actual execution records, raw logs and the same artifacts. Software "
"models, linking, independent consumption and two network-disabled rebuilds "
"prove their own scopes; success in one does not replace another."

msgid "物理记录按 [HIL 状态](hardware.md)另行判断。"
msgstr ""
"Assess physical records separately according to [HIL status](hardware.md)."

msgid ""
"原 `/workspace/...`、`/dev/shm/...` 是执行主机定位，离开该主机不能当作公开下载。 构建系统索引的 "
"`evidence_navigation` 明确候选归档、candidate document、ELF／BIN／map 和全部 member "
"清单的定位方式。归档当前是原记录的本地留存；没有发布的远程证据 不能伪造下载 URL。文档包包含原 JSON "
"以便核对，并不复制大型原始归档或重签历史字节。"
msgstr ""
"Original `/workspace/...` and `/dev/shm/...` paths locate the execution "
"host; they are not public downloads elsewhere. The build-system index's "
"`evidence_navigation` specifies candidate archives, candidate documents, "
"ELF/BIN/map and complete member-inventory locations. Archives are currently "
"retained locally as recorded; do not invent download URLs for unpublished "
"remote evidence. Documentation packages include original JSON for checking; "
"they do not copy large raw archives or re-sign historical bytes."

msgid "![软件与物理证据分别绑定精确源码和执行范围](../assets/diagrams/qualification-evidence.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![Software and physical evidence separately bind exact source and execution "
"scope](../assets/diagrams/qualification-evidence.svg)"

msgid "软件与物理证据分别绑定精确源码和执行范围"
msgstr ""
"Software and physical evidence separately bind exact source and execution "
"scope"

msgid ""
"FIG-11 表达资格关系，不生成 receipt。标准与图源依据见 [图册](../assets/diagrams/README.md)。 "
"逐项原退出条件见 [台账视图](ledgers.md)。"
msgstr ""
"FIG-11 expresses qualification relationships without generating receipts. "
"See the [diagram atlas](../assets/diagrams/README.md) for standards and "
"source authorities, and the [ledger views](ledgers.md) for original per-task"
" exit conditions."
